      <p class="eyebrow mb-4" style="color: var(--orange);">Blog</p>
      <h1 class="text-white mb-5" style="max-width: 22ch; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 5vw, 3rem);">Why Ireland Is One of the Best Places in the World to Learn English</h1>
      <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); font-size: 0.88rem; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 500; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;">22 December 2025 &middot; By Cathal Leonard <span style="opacity:0.5;">·</span> 3 min read</p>
